fix: separate unprivileged Android compile from pinned-stage workflows

Move prepare, sign, and finalize into reusable workflows so OIDC stays off the compile job. Recompute the Mercury canonical spec hash, verify resource digests, sign AAB as well as APK, and report finalize failures when an upstream stage fails.
